  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1)\n\nA few showers will be possible into the evening hours. A cold front \nis moving through the area and dry conditions are generally expected\novernight through Friday night. A weak system will bring some showers\nand storms to the region on Saturday. A larger system will move\nthrough Sunday into Monday bringing more widespread shower and\nthunderstorm chances to the area.\n\nKEY MESSAGE 2)\n\nWith the passage of the cold front today, cooler air will work into\nthe region and below normal temperatures are expected for most\nlocations through the week. High temperatures in most locations will\nbe in the 70s to low 80s this next week. Low temperatures will be in\nthe middle 50s to middle 60s.",
